# Build context of services/tour/Dockerfile (task 1.3, #365). The build context is the repo root (compose files,
# CI images.yml), so BuildKit reads this file, next to the Dockerfile, and not the root .dockerignore.
# Allow list: only what the Dockerfile copies is sent to the builder.
*
!services/tour/
!shared/
**/node_modules
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/npm-debug.log*
services/tour/test/
services/tour/README.md
services/tour/Dockerfile*
shared/test/
